    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No, but I’d love to! Since my extraversion score is high, I imagine AI tools like chatbots could make math interactive—like a collaborative tutor. My openness (97) suggests I’d enjoy exploring creative problem-solving methods, even if traditional teaching feels rigid.",
